<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with Qantas Customer Care regarding your call to our Frequent Flyer Service Centre.<br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear you had a lengthy wait before getting through to the team. We strive to answer every enquiry as soon as possible and monitor call times as well as roster additional staff for particularly busy periods.<br />
<br />
Occasionally, call volumes are more than our predictions. When this happens, we really appreciate the patience of our customers.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to providing Australia's best airline loyalty program and your feedback helps us to &nbsp;identify ways to improve our processes.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that your comments have been forwarded to the relevant team for review. We appreciate your loyalty and I hope that we can welcome you on board again soon.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</body>
